WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
Lode Runner, you're a highly trained galactic commando deep in enemy territory.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:11.040
Your mission? To recover a fortune in gold, stolen from the bungeling people by their power-hungry leaders.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:34.640
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:35.860
I'm Mike.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:36.920
I'm Sam.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.560
