Honestly. So, now your task is to infiltrate each of the 50 different treasure rooms.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.700
That's right. There's 50 levels in this game.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:13.760
Oh, jeez. And evade the deadly bungeling guards and recover every stack of bungeling booty.

