See, now the fruits and vegetables makes more sense.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.440
Right. Because of the fast food tax.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.320
Yes, exactly. I'm glad you understand.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.200
So, it's like, you can just get these.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:59.380
Yeah, this is actually a post-burger time world.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:05.840
Where people, the chef from Burger Time is having so many nightmares about making those

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:10.080
patties that he decided to tax all of the people, so this way he wouldn't have to make

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.660
any more burgers. I didn't know this whole time.

